# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# Keep locally generated TLS material out of git.  README.md and this
# file are the only tracked artefacts in this directory; ca.pem,
# client.pem and client.key are produced on the developer's machine.

# Private keys -- never commit.
*.key
*.priv

# Certificates, CSRs and keystore bundles.
*.pem
*.crt
*.cer
*.der
*.csr
*.p12
*.pfx

# Tracked artefacts.
!README.md
!.gitignore
